---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service - MyPincodes.in"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of MyPincodes.in postal directory and courier utility tools."
  activePage="home"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      
      <div class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-6">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-600 tracking-wider">Legal Terms</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-1">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-2">
          Last updated: October 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>MyPincodes.in</strong>. By accessing or using this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of our site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">1. Use of Content & Tools</h2>
        <p>
          All information, postal data lookup tools, Speed Post calculators, and address formatters provided on MyPincodes.in are for informational and logistical guidance purposes only. While we endeavor to keep the information current and accurate, we make no representations or warranties of any kind regarding completeness or accuracy.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The website design, proprietary software scripts, calculators, user interface, brand assets, and curated layouts are the property of MyPincodes.in. Public domain government data (such as postal code assignments) remain the property of their respective official bodies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall MyPincodes.in, its operators, or contributors be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from the use of or inability to use our tools, postal calculations, or directory entries.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">4. Modifications to the Service</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to withdraw or amend our service, data tables, or utilities without notice.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
